{"id": "EUVD-2026-98044", "enisaUuid": "c6436543-0236-3bc9-9e95-72a695030fb1", "description": "Frappe ERPNext before 15.119.0 and 16.x before 16.31.0 contains a stored cross-site scripting vulnerability because record fields are rendered into an HTML attribute context without escaping. A low-privilege user can store a malicious payload in a record field that executes in the browser of any privileged user who opens the affected page, enabling account takeover.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T22:22:24", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T16:44:54", "baseScore": 8.5, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:P/VC:H/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/security/advisories/GHSA-8pr6-r75h-h8xx", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/frappe-erpnext-before-15.119.0-stored-xss-leading-to-account-takeover"], "aliases": ["GHSA-g9jx-m3gp-q3jv", "CVE-2026-109653"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.21, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "35e1fe60-8295-39be-8819-5526b0ce385d", "product": {"name": "ERPNext", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}, "product_version": "16.0.0-beta.1 <16.31.0"}, {"id": "7e71f9f8-ac45-329d-812b-343e976cc7e3", "product": {"name": "ERPNext", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}, "product_version": "0 <15.119.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "916a5f74-7132-3e4d-b70d-1bdf699afb9d", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}], "isExploited": false}